{"id": "5b22ce8f174e5d0f389c6998", "name": "MirageFox: APT15 Resurfaces With New Tools Based On Old Ones", "description": "he malware involved in this recent campaign, MirageFox, looks to be an upgraded version of a tool, a RAT believed to originate in 2012, known as Mirage.\n\nAPT15 is known for committing cyberespionage against companies and organizations located in many different countries, targeting different sectors such as the oil industry, government contractors, military, and more. They are known for \u201cliving off the land,\u201d meaning they use already available tools and software installed on the computer to operate, and once inside a target network, they will tailor their malware specifically to the target.", "author_name": "AlienVault", "modified": "2018-06-14T20:22:39.919000", "created": "2018-06-14T20:22:39.919000", "tags": ["apt15", "MirageFox", "mirage", "RoyalAPT", "APT", "RAT", "intezer"], "references": ["https://www.intezer.com/miragefox-apt15-resurfaces-with-new-tools-based-on-old-ones/"], "public": 1, "adversary": "APT 15", "targeted_countries": [], "malware_families": [], "attack_ids": [], "industries": [], "TLP": "white", "indicators": [{"id": 1012202207, "indicator": "016948ec7743b09e41b6968b42dfade5480774df3baf915e4c8753f5f90d1734", "type": "FileHash-SHA256", "created": "2018-06-14T20:22:41", "content": "", "title": "", "description": "", "expiration": null, "is_active": 1}, {"id": 1012202208, "indicator": "1534432fafb21c0479343bc2d9f3991e56c75baa41c54b3470d41055bb578f8f", "type": "FileHash-SHA256", "created": "2018-06-14T20:22:41", "content": "", "title": "", "description": "", "expiration": null, "is_active": 1}, {"id": 1012202209, "indicator": "24b3c3527a2431d1c1dd27fe6566ddcaa8e4b92e31e468bb733e827350830a14", "type": "FileHash-SHA256", "created": "2018-06-14T20:22:41", "content": "", "title": "", "description": "", "expiration": null, "is_active": 1}, {"id": 1012202211, "indicator": "28d6a9a709b9ead84aece250889a1687c07e19f6993325ba52